@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Health live
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Health ready
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### List import jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports?page=1&limit=20

### Create users import job (capture id from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "manual-import.http",
  "rows": [
    {
      "name": "Teste Um",
      "email": "teste.um+http@stress.local",
      "document": "11111111111",
      "external_ref": "http-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Teste Dois",
      "email": "teste.dois+http@stress.local",
      "document": "22222222222",
      "external_ref": "http-2"
    }
  ]
}

### Get import job by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{jobId}}

### List import errors by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{jobId}}/errors?page=1&limit=20
